    m_LineSpacing: 1.25
  m_Text: "<b>M\u1EE4C TI\xCAU NHI\u1EC6M V\u1EE4:</b>\nKh\xE1m ph\xE1 khu\xF4n vi\xEAn
    <b>\u0110\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc C\xF4ng nghi\u1EC7p TP. H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh</b> v\xE0
    ch\u1EE5p \u0111\u1EE7 <b>3 \u0111\u1ECBa \u0111i\u1EC3m danh ti\u1EBFng</b>:\n 
    1. <color=#38bdf8>C\u1ED5ng Ch\xEDnh Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng (Gate 01)</color> \u2014
    \u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng Nguy\u1EC5n V\u0103n B\u1EA3o\n  2. <color=#38bdf8>S\xE2n
    Trung T\xE2m (Central Courtyard)</color> \u2014 Khu\xF4n vi\xEAn s\xE2n tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
    tho\xE1ng \u0111\xE3ng\n  3. <color=#38bdf8>M\u1EB7t Ti\u1EC1n T\xF2a Nh\xE0
    A (Block A)</color> \u2014 S\u1EA3nh ch\xEDnh nh\xE0 hi\u1EC7u b\u1ED9\n\n<b>H\u01AF\u1EDANG
    D\u1EAAN THAO T\xC1C:</b>\n\u2022 Nh\u1EA5n ph\xEDm <b>[C]</b> ho\u1EB7c b\u1EA5m
    n\xFAt <b>[M\u1EDF M\xE1y \u1EA2nh]</b> tr\xEAn HUD \u0111\u1EC3 v\xE0o \u1ED1ng
    ng\u1EAFm.\n\u2022 R\xEA chu\u1ED9t c\u0103n ch\u1EC9nh g\xF3c m\xE1y sao cho
    c\xF4ng tr\xECnh n\u1EB1m r\xF5 trong khung h\xECnh.\n\u2022 Nh\u1EA5n <b>[Space]</b>
    / Click chu\u1ED9t \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EE5p \u1EA3nh.\n\u2022 M\u1ED7i \u0111\u1ECBa
    \u0111i\u1EC3m ho\xE0n th\xE0nh l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EA7u nh\u1EADn ngay <color=#fbbf24><b>+100
    \u0111i\u1EC3m</b></color>.\n\u2022 Nh\u1EA5n <b>[Q]</b> ho\u1EB7c <b>[ESC]</b>
    \u0111\u1EC3 tho\xE1t \u1ED1ng ng\u1EAFm quay v\u1EC1 di chuy\u1EC3n t\u1EF1
    do."
